  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Range:</strong> 5 spaces</p><p>You gaze into a creature's circulatory system to learn more about them.</p><p>Choose a blooded creature within <strong>5 spaces</strong> and make a <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check resisted by the target’s <strong>Resilience</strong>.</p><p>If you succeed, you learn one of the following pieces of information per difference in successes.</p><ul><li><p>If they are afraid or nervous.</p></li><li><p>If they are lying.</p></li><li><p>What type of creature they are.</p></li><li><p>Their current <strong>Stamina.</strong></p></li><li><p>Their current <strong>Body</strong>.</p></li><li><p>If they have <strong>Resolve</strong>, and if so how much.</p></li></ul>",
